sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser as Browser / CLI
    participant GW as Gateway / Route<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant KAP as kube-auth-proxy<br/>4180/TCP HTTP (or HTTPS)
    participant API as Kubernetes API<br/>kubernetes.default.svc 443/TCP
    participant OAuth as OpenShift OAuth server<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Up as Upstream RHOAI component

    Note over Browser,OAuth: Flow 1 - Browser login via OpenShift OAuth
    Browser->>GW: GET / (no session)<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    GW->>KAP: Forward<br/>HTTP/4180 (or TLS)
    KAP->>API: GET /.well-known/oauth-authorization-server<br/>TLS (SA CA)
    API-->>KAP: OAuth endpoints
    KAP-->>Browser: sign_in -> /oauth2/start<br/>Set CSRF cookie, 302 to authorize
    Browser->>OAuth: Authorize<br/>HTTPS, user credentials
    OAuth-->>Browser: 302 with code + state
    Browser->>KAP: GET /oauth2/callback<br/>CSRF cookie + code (via gateway TLS)
    KAP->>OAuth: Token redeem<br/>HTTPS, client ID + SA token secret
    OAuth-->>KAP: User access token
    KAP->>API: GET /apis/user.openshift.io/v1/users/~<br/>User bearer token
    API-->>KAP: User identity + groups
    KAP-->>Browser: Set-Cookie _oauth2_proxy<br/>AES-CFB + HMAC-SHA256

    Note over Browser,Up: Flow 2 - Envoy ext_authz with CLI bearer token
    Browser->>GW: Request<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+, Authorization: Bearer
    GW->>KAP: ext_authz subrequest /oauth2/auth<br/>4180/TCP, forwarded bearer/cookie
    alt TokenReview cache miss (10s TTL)
        KAP->>API: POST TokenReview<br/>TLS (SA CA), ServiceAccount token
        API-->>KAP: status.authenticated
    end
    alt Authenticated
        KAP-->>GW: 202/200 + identity headers
        GW->>Up: Forward<br/>TLS (DestinationRule), identity headers
        Up-->>GW: Response
        GW-->>Browser: Response
    else Not authenticated
        KAP-->>GW: 401 (JSON for mlflow-python-client)
        GW-->>Browser: 401
    end

    Note over Browser,API: Flow 3 - Sign-out
    Browser->>KAP: GET /oauth2/sign_out<br/>Session cookie (via gateway TLS)
    KAP->>API: DELETE /apis/oauth.openshift.io/v1/oauthaccesstokens/name<br/>User bearer token
    API-->>KAP: Deleted
    KAP-->>Browser: Clear cookie, 302 to IdP end_session or rd
